9. Material breach
-------------------
The Licensor may terminate your permissions for a material breach not
remedied within 30 days after written notice. This remedy period does
not authorise Commercial Activities: those require agreement before
they begin. Section 5 separately governs patent proceedings.

After termination, stop exercising permissions granted here. Compliant
recipients retain their own permissions. Ownership, independent rights,
result ownership and the warranty and liability provisions continue
to apply where relevant.

